BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (discount. A broker is a pipe for trips, not a partner, and operators who treat it as anything more get) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (squeezed.) Tj ET
