BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 605.77 Tm (The most expensive failure is total broker dependence. Joel Davis walked through a client who lost about) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 590.55 Tm ($185K after buying the wrong vehicles on bad advice and is still waiting on roughly $45K from ModivCare,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 575.32 Tm (alongside a second client whose MTM audit claims $75K owed on disputed trips worth about $20K while) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 560.10 Tm (demanding flat rates; Davis calls broker agreements sharecropping and notes both clients were 100 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 544.87 Tm (broker-dependent [A2vs7pLblSk @ 00:09:40]. A taxi company turned NEMT provider running 25 to 40 legs a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 529.65 Tm (day across 50 counties with LogistiCare got the same verdict: the house is completely built on sand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 514.42 Tm ([xx3dHh731rY @ 00:20:18]. Davis also warns against leaning on broker software, because brokers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 499.20 Tm (eventually lose their contracts and a provider wired into their systems collapses with them [Bvcsc1hEgT0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 483.97 Tm (00:06:22]. Nemt University puts a number on that churn: Verida takes all five Georgia regions on April 1,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 468.75 Tm (2026 as ModivCare exits, and about 30 percent of providers fail to re-credential in time after a broker switch,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 453.52 Tm (with credentialing alone taking 21 to 45 days [zXw7440bths @ 00:06:26]. The check is blunt: if one broker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 438.30 Tm (transition or one audit letter can choke cash flow, broker share is too high.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.07 Tm (The second trap is signing or renewing at rates that cannot carry the truck. Davis showed a Southeast Trans) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.85 Tm (offer a provider was pushed to sign on January 12: ambulatory at a $7.23 base with six miles included and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 392.62 Tm ($1.32 per mile after, wheelchair at $17 base with the same six miles and $1.48 per mile [v-IpSBjauKY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 377.40 Tm (00:03:12]. A ModivCare holdout on 14 base at $1.65 per mile had seen no increase since 2019 despite gas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 362.17 Tm (and labor costs, had done no hospital or nursing-home outreach in that stretch, and now faced a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.95 Tm (late-renewal penalty of up to $2,500 a month [v-IpSBjauKY @ 00:20:18]. Travae Willis reports North) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 331.72 Tm (Carolina insurance rising about 40 percent and companies going out of business because of it, so the advice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 316.50 Tm (is stay small and price trips to cover insurance [YFWOnVDBziM @ 00:08:10]. Under all of it sits the leakage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.27 Tm (brokers keep: they get paid for trips that are not performed while the provider does not, which is why Davis) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 286.05 Tm (says to negotiate no-show pay whenever you hold leverage [Bvcsc1hEgT0 @ 00:12:00]. Run the per-trip) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.82 Tm (math against insurance, fuel, and driver cost before the signature, not after the first quarter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 255.60 Tm (The third cluster is launch and operating mistakes that kill new entrants. WholeRoute's Jay says only half of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.37 Tm (applicants land a broker contract and 70 percent of those are out of business within the first year, with 80 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.15 Tm (85 percent of new applicants being first-time business owners competing against established taxi fleets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 209.92 Tm ([rLXiXIWHxIA @ 00:02:01]. Davis warns off both ends of the vehicle market, new vans at $80K to) Tj ET
