BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.47 Tm (00:13:31]. On the VA side, Travae Willis says the callers asking about your van count and rates are usually) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 164.25 Tm (management firms with no vans that win the SAM.gov bid and pay pennies on the dollar, and that even a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 149.02 Tm (seasoned operator with about 18 vans could not handle a roughly 20,000-trip-a-year contract) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 133.80 Tm ([YFWOnVDBziM @ 00:06:44]. Once inside a broker network, enforcement bites: the MTM Michigan letter) Tj ET
